* LT6106 High-Side Current Sense Amplifier
* 100 mA load current sensed with a 0.1 ohm shunt on a 12 V rail
* Gain = Rout/Rin = 10k/100 = 100  ->  Vsense = 10 mV, Vout = 1.0 V
*
* ---------------- Supply / load path ----------------
V1 IN 0 DC 12
Rsense IN LOAD 0.1          ; shunt resistor, 10 mV at 100 mA
Rload  LOAD 0 119.9         ; sets ~100 mA load current
*
* ---------------- Gain setting network ----------------
Rin  LOAD NIN 100           ; input resistor: Isense = Vsense/Rin = 100 uA
XU1  IN NIN OUT 0 LT6106    ; +IN  -IN  OUT  V-
Rout OUT 0 10k              ; output resistor: Vout = 100 uA * 10k = 1.0 V
*
* Optional light load / measurement capacitance on the output
Cout OUT 0 100p
*
* ---------------- Models ----------------
.lib LTC.lib
*
* ---------------- Analysis ----------------
.tran 0 2m 0 1u
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM=1.5m TO=2m
.end
